  "_quarantine": "Checks that do NOT run in CI, each with the reason. Broken on main itself, or cannot work without a GPU. Fix the check (or main), then delete its line here.",
  "quarantine": {
    "campus-court-detail.mjs": "red on main, no browser needed, same on the laptop: js/campus-landscape.js no longer has the ' function detailMesh(B,f){' block the test cuts out (assert at line 8)",
